### Auth: Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@fake.com",
    "password": "fakePassword",
    "display_name": "Fake User"
}

###

### Auth: Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

###

### Auth: Get Current User (requires access token)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# ###

# ### Auth: Refresh Access Token (requires refresh token cookie)
# POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/refresh
# Cookie: refreshToken={{refreshToken}}

###

### Auth: Logout (clear refresh token cookie)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/logout
Cookie: token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsImlhdCI6MTc2MjM1OTM0OSwiZXhwIjoxNzYyMzYwMjQ5fQ.NHcOXed2umqQLuGJq1Z6WSiUxHLIMpN0ld2hsAX9KUE

